# =============================================================================
# The Cadenza repository. `main` holds the durable source of truth — the specification tree,
# the neutral build-loop commands (commands/), the entry point (start.sh), and the seed
# toolchain under implementation/seed/. Regenerated, machine-local, and agent-local artifacts
# are ignored below: the built `implementation/stable` binary, the target/ dirs, and the
# gitignored .claude/ (into which commands/ and skills/ are installed as local generated targets).
# =============================================================================

# Editor / OS / agent-local
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
.direnv/
result
.claude/

# stray editor/rust-analyzer flycheck output at repo root
target/

# Compiled seed compiler binary (regenerable via cargo build)
implementation/stable
Cargo.lock
